{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S01、S05这类短停留页面上，未标注时点的感受词铺得过密，Y的左右分栏和筛选后的短词更容易快速扫读。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用加亮关键词把每段的心理转折钉得很清楚，而且保留了更多细微的动机变化，例如想靠近却怕索取太多、得到回应却仍然孤单、明明愿意付出却害怕失去。反复出现的水波、小船、摇荡与靠岸意象，也让音乐变化和人物心境形成连续的呼应；Y虽然叙述更顺、更容易扫读，但压缩掉了一些重要的心理层次和具体的音乐细节。综合来看，X的信息组织和情感表达更有深度，主要短板是部分页面的信息呈现过密。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "718714e5-e622-420c-b96d-06dbd8772c61", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T163514369676Z", "elapsed_seconds": 121.562, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:37:15.938297+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a98ff7d83cedafa71161c51d1c49321f491a4c338f5c6cfd2db13dab4ab5c6e1", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_we